<title>USA: Helmerich plans added Atwood investment.</title>
<headline>Helmerich plans added Atwood investment.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helmerich &amp; Payne Inc said Friday it plans to make an additional investment of $20 million to $25 million in its equity affiliate, Atwood Oceanics Inc.</p>
<p>Atwood earlier in the week said it filed a registration statement for the sale of 1.5 million shares of common stock of the company. To maintain its existing 23.8 percent ownership interest in Atwood, Helmerich &amp; Payne, an energy-oriented company, said it plans to buy 25 percent of the shares to be offered, excluding the underwriter's overallotment.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
